      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd like to dig this back up. For Oculus it could be pressing both thumbsticks. There are cases where you end up in a chair you can't get out of because you can't hit the respawn button on the menu and it maliciously jitters you across the whole map. Implementing a hotkey like that could help combatting this without needing to redo the quick menu.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
