      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Reviving this.\nIn VR Oculus Rift here i would also like to comment along with bieng on a chair. If you are moving or falling in any way, its near impossible to click the respawn button. So if you end up in an infinite fall or something making you stuck, then its near impossible to respawn or click anything.\nVery often this forces me to force close VRChat on my desktop to even get back to playing.",
      "viewerReactions": null
